{"year":"2022","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 75th edition was held on March 13, 2022, at the Royal Albert Hall in London, hosted by Rebel Wilson. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 438631, 'screen_type': movie}\">Dune</a> (2021) led the nominations, with 11, and won five awards, including Cinematography, Original Score and Special Visual Effects, but the big winner of the night was <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 600583, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Power of the Dog</a> (2021), which took Best Film and Best Director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 10757, 'screen_type': person}\">Jane Campion</a>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1360281, 'screen_type': person}\">Lashana Lynch</a> won the EE Rising Star Award, the only award voted on by the British public."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":600583,"name":"Ataque dos Cães","image_path":"/rgDJDLFKOKF0dpbaVwgbvjbyZgM.jpg","director":"Jane Campion","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/gAsHuCQMN7mv4uFIvM4ACQ09hPr.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":777270,"name":"Belfast","image_path":"/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg","director":"Kenneth Branagh","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":646380,"name":"Don't Look Up","image_path":"/6Sc7Tjt7aPsdghYK32mDMFeZkqJ.jpg","director":"Adam McKay","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":438631,"name":"Dune","image_path":"/uzERcfV2rSHNhW5eViQiO9hNiA7.jpg","director":"Denis Villeneuve","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":718032,"name":"Licorice Pizza","image_path":"/deV9SBeCQG2rrbKBsWQDiMerQjQ.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Outstanding British Film","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":777270,"name":"Belfast","image_path":"/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg","director":"Kenneth Branagh","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/l1Z9PLy8AXiqlZmFEgiGWeSFdSX.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":714011,"name":"After Love","image_path":"/mXaNg69iWEs0Qsj4AJxcvCXuWKw.